    "GROUP OF CONDITIONS": "GROUPE DE CONDITIONS",
    "Get the graph again from the program in the editor, after you change the program": "Obtenir \xE0 nouveau le graphe du programme de l'\xE9diteur, apr\xE8s une modification du programme",
    "Get the tree again from the program in the editor, after you change the program": "Obtenir \xE0 nouveau l'arbre du programme de l'\xE9diteur, apr\xE8s une modification du programme",
    "Held counts": "D\xE9comptes",
    "How many levels of conditions to show around the query. More levels show more detail, but the tree gets larger.": "Combien de niveaux de conditions montrer autour de la requ\xEAte. Plus de niveaux montrent plus de d\xE9tails, mais l'arbre grandit.",
    "How the boxes are put on the page": "Comment les bo\xEEtes sont plac\xE9es sur la page",
